      "created_at": "2017-09-01T21:40:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was staring at Portja’ s hair in the early incarnation, and I’m not sure if it’s short hair like a boy, or just slicked down with a lot of hair product.</p>\n<p>I love her hair in the extremist Variant, it’s short, but flowy. (My wife hates her hair that length, cuz it’s too short to tie on a bun, but just long enough to get in your face.)</p>\n<p>I could see it going either way. Either the arena required extra short hair or extra product to keep it slicked down as part of a restriction. And then later she stopped with the product or just let it grow out. What do y’all think?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:50:03.676Z",
