    {
      "id": 202703,
      "name": "Jeysie",
      "username": "Jeysie",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-09-03T11:58:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hair doesn't really work that way anyway, per real world science at least. Hair is technically made of dead stuff; so she could get her hair follicles to produce new hair, maybe, but she couldn't actually shrink or grow the hair itself. Which is a shame, because that would be a really cool power to have. What woman wouldn't want the ability to have a new hairstyle all the time? Especially since whether your hair is straight, wavy, curly, is based on the shape of your hair follicle, so being able to alter your follicles too would make the power even better.</p>",
